est composites and advanced materials trade show in North America, CAMX provides an unparalleled platform to connect with industry leaders, engineers, and innovators from across the globe. For us, it\u2019s more than just an exhibition \u2013 it\u2019s a chance to engage in meaningful discussions, explore the latest industry trends, and share how our advancements in alumina fiber technology are helping to solve critical challenges across multiple sectors.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-edefb81 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"edefb81\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6620475 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6620475\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/CAMX-Orlando-e1756972909120-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1611\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/CAMX-Orlando-e1756972909120-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/CAMX-Orlando-e1756972909120-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/CAMX-Orlando-e1756972909120-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/CAMX-Orlando-e1756972909120.jpg 1294w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4150eb8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4150eb8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68f78ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"68f78ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>Showcasing Vulcan Shield Global\u2019s Alumina Fiber Innovations<span style=\"color: rgb(110, 193, 228); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\"><\/span><\/h2><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9ca81e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d9ca81e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At our booth, we will highlight our portfolio of alumina fiber products, designed to meet the demanding needs of industries where performance under extreme conditions is essential:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de32875 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de32875\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul type=\"disc\"><li>Continuous Alumina Fiber Products \u2013 Including fiber yarn, sewing thread, braided rope, braided sleeve, woven tape, and woven fabric. These solutions deliver exceptional tensile strength, low density, and thermal stability, making them ideal for aerospace, automotive, and other high-performance applications.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li>Discontinuous Alumina Fiber Products \u2013 Such as bulk fiber, needled blankets, and paper. These products provide outstanding high-temperature insulation and electrical insulation, with proven applications in areas like electric vehicles and advanced energy systems.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee8308a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ee8308a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Together, these solutions empower industries to achieve greater thermal efficiency, safety, and lightweight performance without compromising durability.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66f4e0c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"66f4e0c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5085902 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5085902\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>The Impact of Alumina Fiber Across Industries<span style=\"color: rgb(110, 193, 228); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\"><\/span><\/h2><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17e1151 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"17e1151\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"459\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VSG-Product-s-1024x734.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1612\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VSG-Product-s-1024x734.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VSG-Product-s-300x215.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VSG-Product-s-768x551.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VSG-Product-s-1536x1101.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VSG-Product-s.png 1565w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed88adb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed88adb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We see alumina fiber as a key enabler of innovation across industries:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da95d8c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"da95d8c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul type=\"disc\"><li>Aerospace: Reliable high-temperature insulation and composite reinforcement.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li>Automotive &amp; EVs: Improved safety and efficiency, especially with fire-resistant barriers and electrical insulation.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li>Energy &amp; Construction: Better thermal performance and long-lasting durability.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li>Composites Manufacturing: Reinforcement for CMC, MMC, and PMC systems that demand heat resistance and strength.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0a4dd87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0a4dd87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>By bringing together strength, lightweight properties, and heat resistance, alumina fiber is opening new pathways for advanced materials applications.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ddf9f74 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ddf9f74\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c6c096 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7c6c096\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>Looking Ahead to CAMX 2025<span style=\"color: rgb(110, 193, 228); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\"><\/span><\/h2><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab30e41 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ab30e41\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We look forward to connecting with professionals from around the world at CAMX 2025, learning from the latest developments in the composites industry, and showcasing how Vulcan Shield Global\u2019s alumina fiber solutions are pushing material science forward.<\/p><p>If you\u2019re attending, we invite you to visit us at Booth C71 to discuss how our technologies can support your projects and future innovations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-el